## Why Not Just Use ChatGPT?"

Here's the difference:

| | This n8n Template | Basic ChatGPT |
|---|---|---|
| **WhatsApp integration** | ✅ Reads incoming messages automatically | ❌ No WhatsApp connection |
| **Inventory check** | ✅ Real-time stock lookup | ❌ No database access |
| **Payment link** | ✅ Generates Paystack invoice | ❌ Can't process payments |
| **Order logging** | ✅ Sheets + Supabase | ❌ Can't write to databases |
| **24/7 automation** | ✅ Runs on a server | ❌ Needs manual prompting |
| **Custom responses** | ✅ Personalized per customer | ❌ Generic replies |

You *could* connect ChatGPT to n8n too — but this template already has the right prompt and structure baked in.

