## How to Customize for Your Business

The template is designed to be modified:

- **Change the AI system prompt** to match your menu or service
- **Add more inventory columns** (supplier, unit cost, profit margin)
- **Connect to your POS** (if you use a system like Zoho, Square, or a custom app)
- **Add SMS fallback** for customers without WhatsApp
- **Multi-language** — change "Hello" to "Sannu" or "Mo" if you serve Hausa/Igbo/Yoruba speakers

