## FAQs

**Q: Do I need to pay for n8n?**
A: No. You can run n8n for free on a small server (or even a Raspberry Pi). If you prefer managed hosting, n8n Cloud starts at $20/month — still cheaper than one employee.

**Q: What if my customers send photos instead of text?**
A: Currently the template handles text messages only. WhatsApp photo messages that contain order info require OCR — let us know and we can add that customization.

**Q: Can this work with Instagram DMs too?**
A: Yes. Swap the Twilio WhatsApp node for the Instagram/WhatsApp Business API. Same principles apply.

**Q: What about M-Pesa?**
A: The Paystack invoice node can also generate M-Pesa payment requests via the Daraja API. We can add that customization on request.
